	// NOTE: VARIANT* out params MUST be declared [in, out] (not [out]).
	//       IDispatch::Invoke (late binding: VBScript/PowerShell/易语言) only writes
	//       back byref storage for [in, out] pointer params; [out]-only VARIANT* args
	//       never read back in late-binding clients. vtable signature is unchanged.
	//       See workbench/repro_dispinvoke2.py for the verification evidence.
